Yes, in your nethack.cnf file, there are lines that say something about
hackdir and several other dirs. make sure that all of them for the hard disk
option are set to declare the path to the dir that the game is in.
For example Mine is:

save d:\misc\games\nethack\*.*;n
bones d:\misc\games\nethack\*.*

On the save dir listing, it's a good idea to tack on the ;n because it keeps
the computer from prompting you to insert the disk.

